WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.540
We demand that businesses like the Yards Plaza, owned by Freeman Properties,

00:05.960 --> 00:11.020
stop giving immigration authorities access to their parking lots.

00:11.600 --> 00:16.820
Stop enabling them to carry out even more terror in our neighborhoods.

00:17.820 --> 00:21.060
You never see the left fight this hard for Americans.

00:21.060 --> 00:25.680
If they can just take 10% of the effort they're wasting on criminal illegals

00:25.680 --> 00:30.120
and have it used on us, the country would be in great shape.

